   "id": "trapping-rain-water",
   "num": 4,
   "leet_id": 42,
   "title_cn": "接雨水",
   "title_en": "Trapping Rain Water",
   "difficulty": "困难",
   "category": "two-pointers",
   "tags": [
    "栈",
    "数组",
    "双指针",
    "动态规划",
    "单调栈"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给定 n 个非负整数表示每个宽度为 1 的柱子的高度图，计算按此排列的柱子，下雨之后能接多少雨水。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "height = [0,1,0,2,1,0,1,3,2,1,2,1]",
      "output": "6"
     },
     {
      "input": "height = [4,2,0,3,2,5]",
      "output": "9"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "n == height.length",
     "1 <= n <= 2 * 10^4",
     "0 <= height[i] <= 10^5"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "每个位置能接的雨水 = `min(左边最高, 右边最高) - 自身高度`。直接对每个位置扫两侧是 O(n²)，前缀最大值数组可做到 O(n)/O(n)。",
     "**双指针可以做到 O(1) 空间**：若 `height[l] < height[r]`，则左侧位置的水位由 `lmax` 决定（右侧必有 `rmax ≥ height[r] > lmax`，短板在左边），所以可以放心结算 `lmax - height[l]`。",
     "于是：谁矮就结算谁、移动谁，一次遍历完成。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "`l=0, r=n-1, lmax=rmax=0, ans=0`",
     "若 `height[l] < height[r]`：更新 `lmax = max(lmax, height[l])`，`ans += lmax - height[l]`，`l++`",
     "否则对称处理右侧：`rmax`、结算 `r`、`r--`",
     "两指针相遇后 `ans` 即总雨水量"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n)",
     "space": "O(1)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def trap(self, height: List[int]) -> int:\n        l, r = 0, len(height) - 1\n        lmax = rmax = 0\n        ans = 0\n        while l < r:\n            if height[l] < height[r]:      # 左边矮，水位由 lmax 决定\n                lmax = max(lmax, height[l])\n                ans += lmax - height[l]\n                l += 1\n            else:                          # 右边矮，水位由 rmax 决定\n                rmax = max(rmax, height[r])\n                ans += rmax - height[r]\n                r -= 1\n        return ans\n"
   },
   "anim": {
    "version": 1,
    "meta": {
     "title": "接雨水 · 双指针谁矮结算谁"
    },
